The reference model is unchanged and the tuned model is saved as `/app/model.xml`.

Changes made:
* Added an `<option>` element after `<compiler>` with solver tuned for speed while keeping physics identical:
  ```xml
  <option solver="PGS" iterations="10" ls_iterations="5"/>
  ```
  `solver="PGS"` is the Projected Gauss-Seidel solver, which is faster for this cable model than the default Newton solver. Iterations were reduced to 10 / 5 – the model still converges to the same state within `atol=1e-5`.

